# A blank after a line's last word hangs past the line's end: in a frame exactly as wide as
# the words, the line keeps them all on one row; 4 pixels narrower, it wraps.
wait 'value="Blank hangs, narrower wraps"'
# In the browser the blank is a space in the text's font, so a mark over it is as tall as the
# line and its glyph sits on the line.
#web wait 'value="Blank box tall and wide, its glyph on its line"'
